  dialogueEntries:
  - layout: 3
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: -1291202924252101130, guid: b73db3f20fa0c8340b1e257aad71719a, type: 3}
    text: "Level 1 Objectives\n\nScan through the map and search for orbs. Collect
      10 for waves 1 and 2, and 16 for the final wave. \n\nEach orb will contain
      a question to solve and a boost if you get the answer right."
  - layout: 1
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bbd2e5c914b66840a3443ee7558b705, type: 2}
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bbd2e5c914b66840a3443ee7558b705, type: 2}
    background: {fileID: -1291202924252101130, guid: b73db3f20fa0c8340b1e257aad71719a, type: 3}
    text: For this level, mag focus muna tayo sa addition at subraction.
  - layout: 1
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bbd2e5c914b66840a3443ee7558b705, type: 2}
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bbd2e5c914b66840a3443ee7558b705, type: 2}
    background: {fileID: -1291202924252101130, guid: b73db3f20fa0c8340b1e257aad71719a, type: 3}
    text: Solve all questions within the given time and run away from monsters bago
      nila maubos yung buhay mo!
  - layout: 1
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bbd2e5c914b66840a3443ee7558b705, type: 2}
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bbd2e5c914b66840a3443ee7558b705, type: 2}
    background: {fileID: -1291202924252101130, guid: b73db3f20fa0c8340b1e257aad71719a, type: 3}
    text: Good luck! Alam kong kaya mo yan!
